    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42860" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Scandĭnāvĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a large and fruitful island in Northern
				Europe;</i> acc. to some, <i>Zealand;</i> acc. to
			others, <i>Schonen</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 3, 6,
			7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 13, 27, § 96</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 15, 16, §
			39</span></i>.—Also called <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Scandĭa</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 16,
				30, § 104</span></i>.</div>
